    check="(1) the same Elite in all six panels; (2) panel 1 the rest pose, the base on the same floor spot in every panel; (3) the body hunkers lower and lower (about 5%, 8%, 10%), leaning forward a few degrees, the eyes narrowing to a hard glare over the shield's top edge; (4) the SHIELD rises along the body: in panels 3 to 5 it covers the lower half of the face (the mouth and the cheeks) but never the eyes, the same shield at the same size; (5) the fist and sword stay clear of the shield and body, the sword upright close beside the face; (6) panel 6 relaxing back toward the rest pose; (7) no glow, no aura, no sparkle, no shield icon, no dust (the buff's glow is added later); (8) the same size in all six, every part at least 10% of the panel from every edge; (9) no GIF and no extra images.",
